  "amenity_note": "Raw 35 amenity columns are one-hot encoded as three discrete levels (0, 1, 9). 9 is never reinterpreted as 0 or 1. amenities_fully_specified replaces the perfectly collinear amenity_known_count / amenity_unknown_count pair of V2. amenities_fully_specified is a DATA-RECORDING / PROVENANCE indicator (did the source record every amenity field), NOT an ordinary property amenity, and must be interpreted as such.",
